        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've never played a game like this—cinematic palace adventure where your moves shape drama!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/38477fe24f88d81e26da936efec65c15.avif?t=1783058959\" width=620 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full live-action on real sets, starring Kuan Hung, Evie Huang, Zeawo, Hana Lin, Qi Xiaxia. 4K HD delivers unprecedented immersion—step into grand Eastern imperial court.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/1a15e600574cd8936a3340aacefff6f8.poster.avif?t=1783058959\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/1a15e600574cd8936a3340aacefff6f8.webm?t=1783058959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/1a15e600574cd8936a3340aacefff6f8.mp4?t=1783058959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/d59b1374e3f765a734100dfa9bd45bad.avif?t=1783058959\" width=620 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where film meets gaming in perfect harmony. Here, every choice you make can take the story in a whole new direction! One moment of misplaced trust could send you spiraling into betrayal and death. Who's manipulating you? Who can you manipulate in return?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/0b8c53908e3d404c7a76e38bb5006a1d.poster.avif?t=1783058959\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/0b8c53908e3d404c7a76e38bb5006a1d.webm?t=1783058959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/0b8c53908e3d404c7a76e38bb5006a1d.mp4?t=1783058959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/9170aedbbced78b6828e090556e42e83.avif?t=1783058959\" width=620 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid multiple story branches and high mortality, can you rise from nobody to power with charm, wisdom, courage? First...survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/a580d3cfcb580a5f8954f1586f2e1e64.poster.avif?t=1783058959\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/a580d3cfcb580a5f8954f1586f2e1e64.webm?t=1783058959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/a580d3cfcb580a5f8954f1586f2e1e64.mp4?t=1783058959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/adb4b4c71a26e46034fcd2cc3b7f47e0.avif?t=1783058959\" width=620 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind imperial court's golden facade: webs of desire, secrets, buried truths. Discover scandals—prince's affair with court bard, princess's hidden lover, vengeful spirits in abandoned Cold Palace, and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/4dabbde8fda42e3e5aac9e2afbbec42e.poster.avif?t=1783058959\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/4dabbde8fda42e3e5aac9e2afbbec42e.webm?t=1783058959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/4dabbde8fda42e3e5aac9e2afbbec42e.mp4?t=1783058959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/7b4e6bc18c051381f8d75be5eae8347e.avif?t=1783058959\" width=620 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ hours content, every playthrough unique. Your choices shape story and you. Get custom Trait Sketch, collect artifacts, unlock hidden plots, crown top picks in popularity contests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/20b03dc41893e743b28f90f2fd87b683.poster.avif?t=1783058959\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/20b03dc41893e743b28f90f2fd87b683.webm?t=1783058959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/20b03dc41893e743b28f90f2fd87b683.mp4?t=1783058959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About New One Studio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are an independent team focused on interactive storytelling, dedicated to innovatively blending Eastern culture with interactive media. In 2019, everyone who journeyed with The Invisible Guardian shared its BAFTA glory, reaffirming that great interactive storytelling can truly stay in people's hearts. Over the past few years, we have immersed ourselves in the prosperous ancient Chinese dynasty, brewing an entirely new story. Road to Empress not only depicts the deadly beauty of Eastern intrigue, but it also brings the audience a battlefield that will test your wisdom and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two works, different stories, one shared vision—we hope users worldwide can once again experience the charm of traditional Eastern culture through our story. It will serve as a bridge across cultures, bringing a brand-new experience to every user who supports FMV works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Road to Empress, you will personally write the epic of a ruling empress. Road to Empress I focuses on her legendary origins—watch how she transforms from an unknown girl into someone who survives the deadly power struggles of a crisis-ridden court through wisdom and courage, gradually emerging as a formidable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Road to Empress II, you return as a seasoned master, and the stakes are brutally higher. Pull the strings from the shadows, keep your ministers in check, and unify an empire amid calculated scheming. You will write every word of a golden age yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Official Orange Light Authorization, with sincere thanks to Orange Light for their music support.)</p>",
